~ start
do GameDialogueManager.change_emote_color.emit(Vector4(0.0, 136/255.0, 0.0, 1.0), Vector4(119.0/255, 187.0/255.0, 119.0/255.0, 1.0))
do GameDialogueManager.change_emote_visibility.emit(true)
do get_parent().get_node("GameRoot/PresetRoot/GrandpaHouse/AnimationPlayer").play("walk_in")
do wait(4)
%2 Grandpa: Ahh, my very special grandchild.
%  Grandpa: There you are, my very special grandchild.
Grandpa: Come catch me up on how you have been.
do get_parent().get_node("GameRoot/PresetRoot/GrandpaHouse/AnimationPlayer").play("meet_grandpa")
do wait(6)
Grandpa: So, how has life been treating you lately?
- Honestly, I feel crushed by the burden of the modern life
	Grandpa: Then you're ready for my gift.
- Genuinely, it feels like my bright spirit is fading before a growing emptieness
	Grandpa: In that case, I have a little gift for you.
Grandpa: I want you to have this sealed envelope.
do get_parent().get_node("GameRoot/PresetRoot/GrandpaHouse/AnimationPlayer").play("give_envelope")
do wait(5)
Grandpa: No, no, don't open it yet... have patience.
%3 Grandpa: Head over to my old farmhouse in [b]Sunset Valley[/b], and once you are there, open the envelope I gave you.
%2 Grandpa: Go to my old farmhouse in [b]Sunset Valley[/b], then open the envelope I gave you there.
Grandpa: Oh, and one more thing... beware of Mayor Wiles.
Grandpa: Now, let Grandpa rest...
do GameManager.dialogue_finished.emit()
do get_parent().get_node("GameRoot/PresetRoot/GrandpaHouse/AnimationPlayer").play("leave")
=> END